{"source_id": "nasa-99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "content_sha256": "99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "experiment": "PSI-117", "filename": "PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "source_path": "psi-117/PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "document_type": "unknown", "evidence_status": null, "text": "6\nTransient Droplet Combustion Model*+\n* T. Farouk and F . L. Dryer Combust. and Flame (2012) 159, 200 – 209\n+ T. Farouk and F . L. Dryer Combust Theory & Modelling (2011), 15, 487 – 515\nLiquid Phase:\n• Mass conservation\n• Species equation\n• Energy conservation\nGas Phase:\n• Multi-component molecular diffusion\n• Detailed chemical kinetics - high and low temperature\n• Mass conservation\n• Species equation\n• Energy conservation\nStatistical\nNarrowband\nRadiation Model\nmv\nT\nr\n∂λ ∂\nqR\nmpsdr\ndt\nl\nT\nr\n∂λ ∂\n,\n,\nli\nli\nYD r∂∂\nDroplet Surface:\n• Surface regression – Adaptive Grid\n• Evaporation of fuel\n• Condensation/Dissolution of products\n• Radiative heat exchange\nFiber Model:\nOne dimensional temperature\ndistribution\nEnergy exchange with\nflame and ambient\nfibq\nambientq\nlossq\nThe code numeric and data\nhandling methodology has\nbeen revised to relax\nnumber of species\nconstraints", "source_locator": "page:6", "page_number": 6, "document_metadata": {"title": "Slide 1", "author": "Tanvir Farouk", "created": "D:20260428082902-04'00'", "modified": "D:20260428082908-04'00'", "producer": "Adobe PDF Library 26.1.183"}, "extraction_warnings": [], "source_url": "https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-117", "source_accession": "PSI-117", "chunk_id": "chunk-a7a459c5a11e7440e1b42bf8a1a33ef0914db72e144f267fb25f988d2288b00e", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_count": 1, "estimated_token_count": 268}
{"source_id": "nasa-99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "content_sha256": "99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "experiment": "PSI-117", "filename": "PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "source_path": "psi-117/PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "document_type": "unknown", "evidence_status": null, "text": "7\nHigh Pressure Helium Exchange – 3 atm\nEvolution of droplet diameter (n-heptane, do =\n4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance\nN2, 3 atm).\nEvolution of peak temperature (n-heptane, do =\n4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance\nN2, 3 atm).\nIntroduction of helium increases the\nburning rate, at higher helium\nconcentration a third stage quasi-steady\nburn is observed\n1st Stage\nHigh Temperature\nburn\n2nd Stage\nModerate\nTemperature burn\nTflame ~ 950 K\n3rd Stage\nLow Temperature\nburn\nTflame ~ 770 K", "source_locator": "page:7", "page_number": 7, "document_metadata": {"title": "Slide 1", "author": "Tanvir Farouk", "created": "D:20260428082902-04'00'", "modified": "D:20260428082908-04'00'", "producer": "Adobe PDF Library 26.1.183"}, "extraction_warnings": [], "source_url": "https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-117", "source_accession": "PSI-117", "chunk_id": "chunk-3f3bababff8e1bde5f9a075e78c4b8bef8be5914a36d3ddb2daa96aff875e684", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_count": 1, "estimated_token_count": 159}
{"source_id": "nasa-99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "content_sha256": "99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "experiment": "PSI-117", "filename": "PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "source_path": "psi-117/PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "document_type": "unknown", "evidence_status": null, "text": "8\nHigh Pressure Helium Exchange – 3 atm\nEvolution of droplet diameter (n-heptane, do =\n4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance\nN2, 3 atm).\nEvolution of peak temperature (n-heptane, do =\n4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance\nN2, 3 atm).\n• The second stage suppresses at\nhigher helium concentration\n• The droplet diameter regression do not\nshow any significant changes\n2nd Stage\nModerate\nTemperature burn\nTflame ~ 950 K\n3rd Stage\nLow Temperature burn\nTflame ~ 770 K", "source_locator": "page:8", "page_number": 8, "document_metadata": {"title": "Slide 1", "author": "Tanvir Farouk", "created": "D:20260428082902-04'00'", "modified": "D:20260428082908-04'00'", "producer": "Adobe PDF Library 26.1.183"}, "extraction_warnings": [], "source_url": "https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-117", "source_accession": "PSI-117", "chunk_id": "chunk-7501b8e37ea56ef1bb4d5be0265b49e28f5eb84afcdf89a87bb749c6bc76fa9e", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_count": 1, "estimated_token_count": 150}
{"source_id": "nasa-99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "content_sha256": "99b341840ed423878c622478b3b7817729d0ccf4d772f407f860a91d66972917", "experiment": "PSI-117", "filename": "PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "file_type": "pdf", "source_path": "psi-117/PSI-117_Presentations_Three_Stage_Cool_Flame_TFarouk.pdf", "document_type": "unknown", "evidence_status": null, "text": "9\nHigh Pressure Helium Exchange – 3 atm\nEvolution of burning rate (n-heptane, do = 4.00\nmm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance N2, 3\natm).\n3rd\n• A second contraction in the flame occurs as\nthe system transitions to the third stage/low\ntemperature burn.\n• Despite the decrease in the maximum\ntemperature it is the flame contraction that\nmakes the droplet diameter regression\ninsensitive to the different burn stages.\nEvolution of flame standoff ratio (n-heptane, do =\n4.00 mm, XO2 = 21%, He exchange with balance\nN2, 3 atm).\n1st\nStage\n2nd\nStage\n3rd\nStage", "source_locator": "page:9", "page_number": 9, "document_metadata": {"title": "Slide 1", "author": "Tanvir Farouk", "created": "D:20260428082902-04'00'", "modified": "D:20260428082908-04'00'", "producer": "Adobe PDF Library 26.1.183"}, "extraction_warnings": [], "source_url": "https://psi.nasa.gov/physci/repo/data/investigations/PSI-117", "source_accession": "PSI-117", "chunk_id": "chunk-4e140c83d1e2dd63c614713057eabc6cd8074472cc8231de5ab0932fec16a11b", "chunk_index": 1, "chunk_count": 1, "estimated_token_count": 175}
